dattobd v0.12.2: REQ_OP_WRITE_ZEROES guard never compiled on kernels >= 6.0 (enum req_op):
bio_helper.c checks HAVE_ENUM_REQ_OPF_WRITE_ZEROES, the configure test defines HAVE_ENUM_REQ_OP_WRITE_ZEROES.
A write-zeroes bio to a snapshotted device then walks a bio without pages -> NULL dereference in bio_needs_cow.
Apply in the dattobd source root after dattobd-hold-thaw.patch: patch -p1 < dattobd-write-zeroes.patch

